              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The United States contends that the Ninth Circuit\u2019s new rule on guilty pleas is not required by the Constitution and would complicate and expose guilty pleas to collateral attack."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
